{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109618","id":2746953220,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6juy4E","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109618","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109618.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109618.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109618","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109618/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109618/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109618/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6fda6c34ab3f5e18e3b871c7fcb65883b09b402c","number":109618,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Small `Tree` optimization","user":{"login":"dagarsar","id":32908423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTA4NDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32908423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar","html_url":"https://github.com/dagarsar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dagarsar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`draw_item` is recalculating the height of an item on drawing every cell, when the result is always the same. This is done to skip drawing cells if they are out of visible `y` positions due to scrolling. However, the loop can be entirely avoided by calculating it before, once, and skipping the cell drawing.\r\n\r\nI did a rudimentary test with a scene with only a `Tree` and this code:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Tree\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tcreate_item()\r\n\tvar item : TreeItem\r\n\tfor i in 50000:\r\n\t\titem = create_item()\r\n\t\titem.set_text(0, \"Tree\")\r\n\tscroll_to_item(item)\r\n\t\r\n\r\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\r\n\tqueue_redraw()\r\n\tprint(Performance.get_monitor(Performance.TIME_FPS));\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `fps` stabilized around 24/25 with this PR, while on `master` it was around 18/19, with these specs:\r\n - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13500 (20 threads) - 31.78 GiB memory","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"I